OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph zone calls after man
OL,4,Akilled and two held
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have called for a 20mph
OL,7,Fspeed limit to be introduced on a busy
OL,8,Fmain road before "more lives are put at
OL,9,Frisk".
OL,11,FA 53-year-old man was pronounced dead
OL,12,Fat the scene following a two-car crash
OL,13,Fat the junction between Smithdown Road
OL,14,Fand Greenbank Road in Liverpool on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FA38-year-old man from Woolton was
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,19,Fby dangerous driving. A second man, 53,
OL,20,Fwas detained on suspicion of causing
OL,21,Fdeath by drug driving.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
